{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1279873-storypath-system-question-do-i-start-with-any-dots-in-my-three-three-paths","id":1279873,"title":"Storypath system question: Do I start with any dots in my three three Paths?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-10T00:29:27-08:00","id":1279873,"title":"Storypath system question: Do I start with any dots in my three three Paths?","content":"The text is unclear, but one of the steps in character gen has me establishing a contact with a singular tag. This leads me to believe I start with a single dot in one Path. Is this correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3108-malckuss","name":"Malckuss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-10T06:13:40-08:00","id":1279889,"title":"","content":"Per page 40 of the Trinity Core, Paths have a rating from 1 to 5, so unless I am sorely mistaken, each of your Paths start at 1. Also, Character Creation (p 36 &amp; 37) say that you get 3 dots in Path Skills and 2 dots in Path Edges for each of your Paths, which is conveniently the same amount of Skill and Edge dots that you get when you advance your Path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-10T06:15:24-08:00","id":1279890,"title":"","content":"This question is also asked here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273369-trinity-continuum-core-clarifications\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...clarifications</a><br /> <br /> My understanding ist that each path begins with one dot. No official statement about this yet, however. (Or I missed it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3122-shuragil","name":"shuragil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-12T21:31:30-08:00","id":1280443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1279873-storypath-system-question-do-i-start-with-any-dots-in-my-three-three-paths?p=1279889#post1279889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Per page 40 of the Trinity Core, Paths have a rating from 1 to 5, so unless I am sorely mistaken, each of your Paths start at 1. Also, Character Creation (p 36 &amp; 37) say that you get 3 dots in Path Skills and 2 dots in Path Edges for each of your Paths, which is conveniently the same amount of Skill and Edge dots that you get when you advance your Path.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which would make sense, except you only get one contact with one tag at character gen and the pool of points for building your contacts increases as you get more dots in paths, too. This is why a clarificatione needs to be made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3108,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3108-malckuss","user":"Malckuss","date":". 01-15-2019, 08:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3108-malckuss","name":"Malckuss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-22T12:26:12-08:00","id":1282175,"title":"","content":"Hrm. Sometimes it takes sending stuff out into the world to realize that something you thought was clear and obvious is not. Yes, you begin the game with 1 dot in each of the three Paths you choose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-22T12:53:45-08:00","id":1282180,"title":"","content":"In Trinity\u2019s the price of raising a path is listed as 18 XP on page 39 and 5 XP on page 41. I assume it\u2019s 18 since raising a path grants 19 XP of benefits on top of more path connection power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T18:49:07-08:00","id":1292329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werlynn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1279873-storypath-system-question-do-i-start-with-any-dots-in-my-three-three-paths?p=1282180#post1282180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Trinity\u2019s the price of raising a path is listed as 18 XP on page 39 and 5 XP on page 41. I assume it\u2019s 18 since raising a path grants 19 XP of benefits on top of more path connection power.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was just considering the same thing myself. <br /> <br /> * 3 Skill Dots (15 XP)<br /> * 2 Edge Dots (4 XP)<br /> * 1 Contact Tag/Dot (2 XP, I was counting a contact like 1 merit dot from CoD)<br /> * 1 Status (2 XP, same thought as above)<br /> * Value of 22 XP<br /> <br /> Best regards","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":25095,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","user":"Graylion","date":". 02-26-2019, 09:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/