rypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T19:16:45-08:00","id":1292334,"title":"","content":"Can you also spend XP to increase your contacts if you do not want to increase your path rating? Best regards <span style=\"color:grey\">Sent from the mobile client - Forum Talker</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T01:58:35-08:00","id":1292408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Graylion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1279873-storypath-system-question-do-i-start-with-any-dots-in-my-three-three-paths?p=1292334#post1292334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you also spend XP to increase your contacts if you do not want to increase your path rating? Best regards <span style=\"color:grey\">Sent from the mobile client - Forum Talker</span></div> </div> </div> </div>No, the path is the source of contacts, the deeper you go in the path, more people you know and more important are the people you know.<br /> <br /> You may create an social edge to give you some contacts, freeing it from the path. Thinking this way, contacts and sidekicks (can\u2019t remamber the name of the other background) are nice social edges...<br /> <br /> There is also a gift for having contacts everywhere...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0